OL,3,GNEWSAState pension likely to top
OL,4,A#13,000 a year as UK wage growth slows
OL,5,Ato 3.9%
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour made a manifesto pledge to keep
OL,8,Fthe triple lock until 2029, however
OL,9,Feconomists have warned about the cost
OL,10,Fof the policy ahead of the Budget
OL,11,Falthough pensioner groups say many
OL,12,Fpeople still face poverty in old age.
